Nonpareil 0.79
https://github.com/brouhaha/nonpareil

The simulator, calculator definitions and artwork retain their original
copyrights and licences. See COPYING, CREDITS, the model's info.txt and the
notices in the corresponding source files. The native X11 front end uses
the original Voyager artwork and calculator ROMs. The build converts PNG
artwork into PPM faces and XBM segment masks and expands the ROM records
into the calculator-definition XML.

Licence filenames are shortened for Atari filesystems:
  GPL-2.txt                 -> LICENSES/GPL2.TXT
  GPL-3.0.txt               -> LICENSES/GPL3.TXT
  CC-BY-SA-3.0.txt          -> LICENSES/CC-BY-SA.TXT
  CC-BY-NC-ND-3.0.txt       -> LICENSES/CC-NC-ND.TXT

The statically linked Expat library is MIT licensed; see expat.txt.
The statically linked nanoprintf library uses its 0BSD licence; see npf.txt.
